"""Regression corpus for the IIIF URI parser.

Consumers:
  * `//src/iiifparser/cpp/classifier:iiif_handler_test` — sweeps the C++
    `parse_iiif_uri` classifier over every input as a regression suite
    (originally the libFuzzer seed corpus; the fuzz harness was retired with the
    oracle, ADR-0020).
  * `//src/iiifparser/rust:corpus_regression_test` — sweeps the production Rust
    `iiif_parser::parse_request` over the same corpus (ADR-0021).

Exposing the corpus as a Bazel `filegroup` lets each test declare it as a `data`
dep and find the files in its runfiles tree — the `cc_test` at a
workspace-relative path (cwd = workspace root), the `rust_test` via the
`@rules_rust//rust/runfiles` library.
"""

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

filegroup(
    name = "seed_corpus",
    srcs = glob(["*"], allow_empty = True),
)
